>860</fpage><lpage>865</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer||69|860||bib19|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1735077</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib20"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>SAS Institute Inc</collab></person-group><article-title/><source>SAS/STAT user's guide</source><year>1988</year><volume>2</volume><publisher-name>Cary, North Carolina: SAS Institute Inc</publisher-name>version 6, 4th edition</citation></ref><ref id="bib21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Segal</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Reinach</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name><name><surname>de Beer</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Factors associated with oesophageal cancer in Soweto, South Africa</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>1988</year><volume>58</volume><fpage>681</fpage><lpage>686</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||58|681||bib21|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3219281</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib22"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sitas</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Madhoo</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Wessie</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title/><source>Incidence of histologically diagnosed cancer in South Africa, 1993&#x02013;1995</source><year>1998</year>National Cancer Registry of South Africa: South African Institute for Medical Research, ISBN 1-874813-08-6</citation></ref><ref id="bib23"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Statistics South Africa</collab></person-group><article-title/><source>Census in Brief</source><year>1998</year><publisher-name>Pretoria: Statistics-SA</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Strebel</surname><given-names>PM</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuhn</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Yach</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Smoking practices in the African township population of Cape Town</article-title><source>J Epidemiol Community Health</source><year>1989</year><volume>43</volume><fpage>209</fpage><lpage>213</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Epidemiol Community Health||43|209||bib24|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2607296</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tuyns</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Pequinot</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Jensen</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Role of diet, alcohol and tobacco in oesophageal cancer, as illustrated by two contrasting high-incidence areas in the North of Iran and West of France</article-title><source>Front Gastrointest Res</source><year>1979</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>101</fpage><lpage>110</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Front Gastrointest Res||4|101||bib25|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">428882</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>van Rensburg</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Bradshaw</surname><given-names>ES</given-names></name><name><surname>Bradshaw</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Rose</surname><given-names>EF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Oesophageal cancer in Zulu men, South Africa: a case-control study</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>1985</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>399</fpage><lpage>405</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||51|399||bib26|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3970816</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vizcaino</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name><name><surname>Parkin</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Skinner</surname><given-names>MEG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Risk factors associated with oesophageal cancer in Bulawayo, Zimbabwe</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>1995</year><volume>72</volume><fpage>769</fpage><lpage>773</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||72|769||bib27|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7669592</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib28"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>World Health Organization (WHO)</collab></person-group><article-title/><source>International Classification of Diseases for Oncology</source><year>1990</year>Second EditionGeneva</citation></ref><ref id="bib29"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>World Health Organization (WHO)</collab></person-group><article-title/><source>Global Status Report on Alcohol</source><year>1999</year>Geneva</citation></ref><ref id="bib30"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yach</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Townsend</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cigarette consumption in South Africa</article-title><source>Smoking and Health in South Africa</source><year>1988</year><fpage>17</fpage><lpage>41</lpage>Technical Report No 1. Centre for Epidemiological Research in Southern Africa: SA Medical Research Council</citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>